('USB networking / tethering','usb_tethering.py · USB NCM gadget · dnsmasq · firewall4','Board-to-PC USB provides management; optional DHCP gateway/DNS advertisements make it the PC uplink.', ['Give an Ethernet-free laptop access to a private LTE application.','Maintain management access while changing Ethernet to WAN.','Commission a router over one data cable without joining its hotspot.'],'USB is 192.168.7.1/24. Off disables gateway/DNS advertisements, not forwarding; a manually routed PC can still use it. Renew leases after changes.'),
